Error [jet.NondeterminismInPureEval]: `Clock copy` is non-deterministic and cannot appear in a pure evaluation.
  --> Tests/UI/Determinism/pure_code_rejects_clock_provenance_laundered_through_a_struct_3.jet:5:52
